      <Distractor>
          <Ref target="cause_connection_4_explanation" />
      </Distractor>
      <Distractor>
Equitable school funding is related to long working hours.
      </Distractor>
      <Key><TextBlock id="factor_connection_2_key">
Equitably funded schools -- especially those in underfunded districts
serving disproportionately large numbers of vulnerable student populations --
are more likely to be able to provide the supports and flexibility
needed by students who must work long hours.
      </TextBlock></Key>
    </ChoiceInput>
